SUMMARY:Who’s up for a trip to China?
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\nI’m interested
  in joining this tour as a traveller (not as a guide). It looks like a nic
 e and affordable tour\, and it will be my first time traveling to China\, 
 something that has always been on my bucket list.\nIn 2026\, Canadian pass
 port holders can travel to China visa-free!\nIf this interests you\, you c
 an find the full details here:\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Best of China: Shanghai\, Suz
 hou\, Hangzhou & Beijing**\n\n* Travel Date: 10-20 September 2026\n* Price
  per person\, in double occupancy: CA$ 4490 (Flights\, 5\\* Hotels\, Tours
 \, some meals\, & Taxes are included).\n* Only a $300 deposit per person i
 s required to secure your spot.\n* This is a locally escorted tour. Our to
 ur guide will meet us upon arrival at the Airport and will accompany us th
 roughout the entire journey.\n\n**Tour page:** [https://funtours.ca/tour/b
 est-of-china-shanghai-suzhou-hangzhou-beijing](https://funtours.ca/tour/be
 st-of-china-shanghai-suzhou-hangzhou-beijing)\nEmail: [sadafholidays20@gma
 il.com](mailto:sadafholidays20@gmail.com)\nPhone: 416-477-2087\nWhatsApp: 
 416-477-2087\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nHope to see you soon at Toronto Pearson Airport
 !\nPeter Gowing\n[pdgowing@gmail.com](mailto:pdgowing@gmail.com)
