SUMMARY:IMPROV and ACTING IN THE PARK!  (with Dinner Party after)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n**Hello everyone\,**\n\nPlease joi
 n us for our a great afternoon with **IMPROV and ACTING in the PARK!**\n\n
 It's a blast! (and no experience required\; just a willingness to have fun
 \, not take ourselves too seriously and laugh a lot!\n\n\\*Joined by my ot
 her groups too\; so we can anticipate a great afternoon\n\nEvent details b
 elow:\n\nSincerely\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\nmeetup.com/soulcit
 y\n\nEvent Details:\n\n**IMPROV and ACTING in the PARK! (Meet at Yonge & L
 awrence Corner)**\n(Dinner Party after)\n\nThis is a well organized event 
 filled with Improv\, skits\, sketch comedy and of course lots of hilarious
  scenes.\n\n-A fun afternoon for all Improv enthusiasts and newbies of Imp
 rov!\n\n\\*No experience required\; just an open mind and a desire to meet
  some wonderful people\, laugh and have fun!\n\n\\*Bring a Blanket or a La
 wn Chair if you like :) (optional)\n\n**Event Fee:** 10 dollars (Cash only
 ) (HST is included)\nor e transfer to steveflemming11@gmail.com\n\n\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n**Location an
 d Meeting Spot:**\n\n\\*We will meet outside the **Toronto Locke Library (
 3083 Yonge Street)** then walk 1 minute south to the Lawrence Park. (South
  East Corner of Yonge and Lawrence)\n\n**(Right beside Subway line\, and p
 lenty of Free Street Parking along Lawrence)**\n\n**-Arrive at 3:00 PM\, w
 e will head down to park together around 3:30**\n-If arriving late you wil
 l see us down at the park- but do your best to come on time :)\n(The park 
 is one block south of Lawrence\, on East side of Yonge)\n\\-\\-\\-
