SUMMARY:🌊 Hamilton Waterfront & 🌿 Cootes Paradise Trail Adventure- 2
  Meetup Times!
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n# 🌊 Hamilton Waterfront & Coote
 s Paradise Trail Adventure\n\nJoin us for a day outside Toronto as we head
  to Hamilton to explore the waterfront and the beautiful trails of Cootes 
 Paradise.\nWe'll begin along the Hamilton waterfront before making our way
  into Cootes Paradise\, where we'll trade city streets for wooded paths\, 
 natural scenery\, and a little bit of adventure.\n\nThere are some hills a
 nd sections of uneven trail\, so come prepared to walk — but that's part
  of what makes this such a great day out.\nThis is a social adventure\, no
 t a formal tour. We're here to explore somewhere different\, get some exer
 cise\, enjoy the scenery\, and most importantly\, spend time together.\n\n
 Don't forget to join our **WhatsApp Group – [CLICK HERE!](https://chat.w
 hatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc)**\n\n***\n\n## 🚆 Getting to Hamilto
 n\n\n### Meetup Location #1 — Toronto\n\n**Outside the Fairmont Royal Yo
 rk facing Front street. This will be the ONLY Meetup spot for this locatio
 n.**\n**Meetup: 9:00AM...we will only wait 15mins**\n**Departure: 9:30 AM 
 sharp**\nLook for me in my Moose Hat.\n\nWe'll take the GO Train from Unio
 n Station to West Harbour GO Station.\nPlease be on time. Once the train l
 eaves\, you will not be able to catch up with the group.\n**GO Train Cost:
 ** Approximately $10 for the Weekend & Holiday One-Day Pass.\nYou can get 
 your pass a week before - [CLICK HERE!](https://www.gotransit.com/en/partn
 ers-and-promotions/weekend-passes-with-go)\n\n### Meetup Location #2 — H
 amilton\n\n**Bayfront Park Parking Lot**\n200 Harbour Front Drive\nWe will
  meet near the flag polls.\n**Meetup: 11:00 AM**\n**We leave for the walk 
 at 11:15 AM.**\nIf you're driving or already in Hamilton\, this is the pla
 ce to meet us.\n\n***\n\n## 🌿 The Walk\n\nWe'll explore the Hamilton wa
 terfront before heading into Cootes Paradise.\nExpect:\n\n* Waterfront vie
 ws\n* Forested trails\n* Natural scenery\n* Some hills\n* A few uneven or 
 off-road sections\n* Plenty of time to chat and enjoy the day\n\nThis isn'
 t a race. We'll keep a steady pace\, but you should be comfortable walking
  for several hours.\n\n***\n\n## 🍔 After the Walk\n\nAfter our hike\, w
 e'll head over to **Hutch's Harbour Front** for some ice cream. You can jo
 in us for or you're welcome to head home whenever you'd like.\n**Return GO
  Train:** We expect to catch either the **2:23 PM or 3:23 PM** train\, dep
 ending on how the day goes.\nYou are also welcome to stay in Hamilton long
 er and make your own way home later.\n\n***\n\n## 💵 Meetup Fee\n\n**$5 
 cash in person or e-transfer**\n**[mathewmaclean@hotmail.com](mailto:mathe
 wmaclean@hotmail.com)**\nThis fee helps support the group and allows us to
  continue creating events like this.\n\n***\n\n## 🎒 What to Bring\n\n* 
 Water\n* Comfortable walking shoes\n* A snack\n* Sunscreen\n* Weather-appr
 opriate clothing\n* Money for lunch and transportation\n\n***\n\n### A Few
  Notes\n\nYou can RSVP in advance or decide on the day if you're unsure ab
 out your schedule.\nSometimes things happen and events may need to be canc
 elled or changed\, so please keep an eye on the event page for updates.\nT
 his group is open to anyone who wants to get outside\, explore the city an
 d surrounding areas\, and meet people along the way — whether you're sin
 gle\, coupled\, new to Toronto\, or have lived here your whole life.\nWe a
 lso host movies\, walks\, hikes\, arts & culture outings\, restaurants and
  more.\n\n**Organizer: Mathew**\nQuestions? Post on the event wall or emai
 l:\n**[torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com](mailto:torontomoviesandoutings
 @hotmail.com)**\n\n## 🌈 The Point of the Day\n\nThe trail is the reason
  we get outside.\nThe adventure is the reason we go somewhere different.\n
 But the people are the reason we keep coming back.\n**Come for the waterfr
 ont.**\n**Stay for the adventure.**\n**Leave with a new connection — and
  maybe a new friend.** 🌊🌿
